        "jsCode": "// 1. Get all the rows found by Supabase\nconst leads = items.map(item => item.json);\n\n// 2. Calculate Stats for the Dashboard\nconst total = leads.length;\nconst called = leads.filter(l => l.call_status === 'called' || l.call_status === 'calling').length;\nconst pending = total - called;\n\n// 3. Return the exact structure the website needs\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    stats: { \n        total: total, \n        called: called, \n        pending: pending \n    },\n    leads: leads\n  }\n}];"
